   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>人工交会图边界固定，岩性类别可能重叠。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>GR、DEN与取心岩性标签。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>用邻近标签投票生成岩性边界和整井柱。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='测井测量原理与交会图分区'><text x='20' y='22' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>井中测量：仪器沿深度连续读数</text><rect x='60' y='36' width='60' height='190' rx='6' fill='#e7f0fb' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-opacity='.4'/><rect x='78' y='120' width='24' height='52' rx='4' fill='#2875c7'/><text x='90' y='150' font-size='8' fill='#fff' text-anchor='middle'>GR</text><line x1='90' y1='36' x2='90' y2='12' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1.5'/><text transform=\"translate(30 28)\" x='90' y='10' font-size='8.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>电缆</text><line x1='140' y1='50' x2='196' y2='50' stroke='#e9eef6' stroke-width='1'/><path d='M140,44 L146,58 L152,40 L158,66 L164,46 L170,70 L176,48 L182,74 L188,52 L196,60' fill='none' stroke='#202b38' stroke-width='1.1'/><text x='200' y='54' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>GR 随深度跳变</text><text x='60' y='240' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>泥岩段 GR 高 · 砂岩段 GR 低</text><line x1='250' y1='20' x2='250' y2='240' stroke='#dfe6f0'/><text x='392' y='22' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>交会图分区：人工画框定岩性</text><rect x='330' y='36' width='310' height='190' fill='#fff' stroke='#dfe6f0'/><ellipse cx='560' cy='80' rx='42' ry='22' fill='#708060' fill-opacity='.3' stroke='#708060'/><ellipse cx='410' cy='88' rx='36' ry='20' fill='#d47a3a' fill-opacity='.3' stroke='#d47a3a'/><ellipse cx='392' cy='150' rx='32' ry='18' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.3' stroke='#41699b'/><ellipse cx='378' cy='200' rx='28' ry='15' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.35' stroke='#2875c7'/><rect x='340' y='46' width='290' height='172' fill='none' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='6 4'/><text x='560' y='62' font-size='9.5' font-weight='600' fill='#708060' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>泥岩</text><text x='410' y='74' font-size='9.5' font-weight='600' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>砂岩</text><text x='392' y='138' font-size='9.5' font-weight='600' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>灰岩</text><text x='378' y='192' font-size='9.5' font-weight='600' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>白云岩</text><line x1='340' y1='226' x2='640' y2='226' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='640' y='240' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='end'>GR (API) →</text><text transform=\"translate(0 20)\" x='338' y='32' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>DEN (g/cm³) ↑</text></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
